893")) (text "3  UART PROGRAMMING — NO USB / NO PROGRAMMER POWER" (at 20.32 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left)) (uuid "e0772f82-b910-5bd5-b06a-18a7913a6eb8")) (text "4  VEHICLE CAN — NO TERMINATION" (at 261.62 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left)) (uuid "ce37aa9d-8c37-5e91-b2c5-ba6528a4b149")) (text "J1 pin 9: +12 V  |  pin 3: ground  |  pin 7: CAN-H  |  pin 2: CAN-L\nOnly use the Nissan ZE0/e-NV200 OVMS cable. Generic OBD cables differ." (at 20.32 92.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "56ebbb7f-b3f2-5b65-80f0-519965f59aa8")) (text "65 V buck with input fuse, reverse blocking and 24 V TVS.\nTransient energy, cold operation and parked draw require physical tests." (at 20.32 115.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "f5430124-9b58-55af-afec-d5606fb81c5a")) (text "J3: 1 GND | 2 board RX | 3 board TX. 3.3 V logic only.\nPower from a current-limited 12 V bench supply via J1 (9 +, 3 GND).\nVehicle unplugged. Adapter power wire unused. Connect only with board powered.\nHold BOOT; press/release RESET; release BOOT. Flash via UART0 at 115200 baud." (at 20.32 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "39691779-f80c-56a5-bf86-080270ebbd5b")) (text "CAN TX: GPIO4  |  RX: GPIO5  |  STB: GPIO1\nSTB is pulled high during reset. Drive low only for a requested action.\n500 kbit/s, standard 11-bit frames; 2013–2015 Leaf profile to be confirmed." (at 261.62 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "5647a333-8096-53e3-af9d-ca0a7c9ec836")) (text "Voltage sense is after the input diode: calibration required.\nSoftware low-battery sleep is required; there is no hardware battery disconnect." (at 261.62 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "c1b32ff2-523a-5436-9a14-23e5d7c06bbd")) (text "GPIO3 / GPIO18 / GPIO19 unused. No USB-presence sensing in Rev E.\nOTA updates need firmware implementation. UART remains the recovery interfac